{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102815","id":2334470921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6LJTMJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102815.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102815","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102815/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102815/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102815/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a7ed0bd62bac9ca00a37cec0a8873f34a78ef2c2","number":102815,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add toggle to Game view for resetting input mode on stop","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a tentative change based on [a discussion](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/editor?msg=N99zqt5p8o34BABqB) on the contributor's chat about the current behavior of the \"Game\" view's input mode.\r\n\r\nSome users have reported finding the current behavior, where the selected input mode (Input/2D/3D) persists across debugging sessions, to be frustrating, as you can sometimes miss that you've left the input mode in 2D/3D when launching a new debugging session and not understand why the game doesn't respond to input.\r\n\r\nThere are several potential ways to address this, but this PR takes the approach of adding another toggle to the \"triple dot\" menu called \"Reset Input Mode on Stop\", which (like the name suggests) resets the input mode back to game input as soon as a debugging session is stopped.\r\n\r\nThis new toggle defaults to being disabled, meaning the input mode will (just like now) persist across debugging sessions by default. Its value is however persisted in the project metadata, so won't need to be enabled every editor session.\r\n\r\nThe naming and placement of all of this is of course up for discussion.\r\n\r\nNote that the way this is implemented does not seem to apply to the \"Remote Deploy\" feature, like when launching the a \"Runnable\" export on mobile devices. I'm not sure if there's any good delineation for \"stopping\" a debugging session in the same way, which might perhaps mean that this needs a different approach.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color